  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/667/667-15.htm",
  "statuteText": "667:15 Endorsement. –\n\nUpon the back of each ballot shall be printed the words \"Official Ballot for Dist. No. ___ , County of __________ , For Delegate to the Constitutional Convention\", the date of the election and a facsimile of the signature of the secretary of state."
}
